thinking-spark

This is an independent, original implementation of small "thinking" indicator
animations (breathing starburst, orbiting dots, dot rings, typing dots).

It is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Anthropic. It does not
contain or redistribute any Anthropic assets, sprite sheets, fonts, or logos.
The starburst shape is generated procedurally from a seeded PRNG at runtime.

If you use this library in a product, you are responsible for your own branding
and trademark compliance. Do not imply endorsement by any third party.
